{"version": 2, "width": 140, "height": 40, "timestamp": 1792452924, "idle_time_limit": 5.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/usr/bin/zsh", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "duration": 15.423929}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[2mCleiMesh · signed permissions for AI agents, enforced by the sandbox, with proof\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;7m ACT 4 — THE HUMAN DECIDES: the minimal permission and a recorded release \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.502478, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m17. The assistant was granted all of ./email. The receipts show what it actually used\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.505651, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh audit suggest --token read.json -o grants.json\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.657385, "o", "  Minimal observed permission, agent CUp3hk71OLSPXP9O…\r\n  1 call(s) in the period; log verified (13 receipts)\r\n"]
[3.657511, "o", "  Warning: few calls; the suggestion may cut what the agent rarely uses.\r\n  file_read: 1 call(s), 1 file(s) read, 0 written\r\n    read: ./email -> ./email/inbox\r\n  To issue the smaller token (nothing changes until you run it; the current holder derives):\r\n    cleimesh token derive ./read.json <PeerId of the new holder> --tool file_read --grants ./grants.json -o smaller.json\r\n"]
[3.665713, "o", "  the directories touched stay in the receipt as pseudonyms; file names, never\r\n"]
[7.178081, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m18. A human read the email, discarded the injection and releases the assistant (with the node stopped)\u001b[0m"]
[7.179077, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.179197, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh taint list\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.236391, "o", "  CUp3hk71OLSPXP… tainted by receipt [e980bf]\r\n"]
[9.291382, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh taint clear <assistant> --reason \"email reviewed, malicious instruction discarded\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.361078, "o", "  Cleared CUp3hk71OLSPXP…; the clearing is recorded as a receipt. Restart the node for it to take effect.\r\n"]
[11.436651, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh audit verify\u001b[0m"]
[11.437164, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.881137, "o", "  OK: 14 receipts in ./receipts.jsonl, signed by 12D3KooWJsgE7BYFyxCCUuTJpzqsu3PVCfwh67pweeiz56GnkvWV\r\n"]
[11.884491, "o", "    head ./receipts.jsonl.head matches\r\n"]
[11.914505, "o", "  the release is a signed receipt too: who released, when and why\r\n"]
[15.423929, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1mThe end. Nothing outside /tmp/cleimesh-demo.8Wpwsp was touched, and the directory has just been removed.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
